                "title": "UKHSA Trust Programme Client Side Partner",
                "description": "This Procurement will establish multiple Supplier Contracts for the purchase of the Contracting Authority's Cyber Transformation Programme - the Trust Programme. These Services will allow the Contracting Authority's Cyber function to design, build, deliver and embed the cyber security, privacy and information and records management controls and solutions. These will be aligned to the DSPT-CAF and will be required to deliver modernised, fit for purpose, compliant and value for money services in support of UKHSA operations.\r\n\r\nThis was a mini-competition of a CCS framework RMRM6100 Technology Services 3 (Lot 1)",
